WEBVTT

00:07.041 --> 00:08.250
[men grunting]

00:14.583 --> 00:16.125
Don't hold back.

00:16.750 --> 00:19.875
I am the original Viral Hit.

00:19.958 --> 00:22.708
-[tense music playing]
-[men laughing]

00:27.250 --> 00:29.250
You know what? You're coming with us.

00:35.000 --> 00:36.083
You bitch!

00:36.958 --> 00:38.416
[man 1 grunting]

00:41.750 --> 00:43.000
[man 2 gasping]

00:44.291 --> 00:45.458
-[yells] Ah!
-[cracking]

00:47.125 --> 00:48.583
[snarls] Ah!

00:49.291 --> 00:50.958
[guard] The hell are you doing?

01:01.958 --> 01:02.833
BE STRONGER

01:02.916 --> 01:04.333
[Kaho] I had the same key chain.

01:07.083 --> 01:08.250
I guess it's rather childish.

01:09.125 --> 01:10.291
No, I don't think so.

01:10.708 --> 01:14.958
It…  was very important to me.

01:16.750 --> 01:19.000
-[somber music playing]
-[no audible dialogue]

01:24.375 --> 01:25.541
[Kaho] Last year,

01:26.250 --> 01:27.875
my mother passed away.

01:29.083 --> 01:30.791
And my father remarried.

01:33.041 --> 01:35.416
I'd treasured it for a long time,

01:35.500 --> 01:37.666
but I must have lost it somewhere.

01:38.708 --> 01:41.250
So, I'd been looking for it
all over the place.

01:41.333 --> 01:43.333
[poignant music playing]

01:45.166 --> 01:48.166
Then I stumbled upon one just like it.

02:04.583 --> 02:07.000
FIGHTING MINDSET
UNLISTED

02:07.666 --> 02:11.375
Hello guys! My name is TOU-KEI.

02:11.458 --> 02:14.166
Why don't you come
2and get stronger with me?

02:14.250 --> 02:15.583
Tell me,

02:15.666 --> 02:17.625
why did you send me those videos?

02:18.250 --> 02:21.291
I saw you being bullied and I was angry.

02:23.625 --> 02:26.625
[boys grunting]

02:26.708 --> 02:29.583
-[Hamaken grunts]
-[Shimura whimpering] I'm sorry.

02:29.666 --> 02:30.500
[Hamaken] Sorry…

02:30.583 --> 02:32.875
-[Kaho] I wanted to help you somehow.
-[dull thud]

02:32.958 --> 02:37.583
So I sent you progressive videos
from the same URL.

02:38.208 --> 02:40.833
[boys grunting on video]

02:40.916 --> 02:42.916
[suspenseful music playing]

02:43.666 --> 02:46.166
[Hamaken] Don't you ever mess
with me again, you hear?

02:46.250 --> 02:47.666
@HOW_TO_FIGHT

02:47.750 --> 02:49.625
[Shimura] Oh, now I understand.

02:50.375 --> 02:53.083
-I'm sorry.
-No. Don't be.

02:53.708 --> 02:57.791
You did all that for a stranger.
That's very considerate.

03:02.750 --> 03:03.875
At any rate,

03:04.541 --> 03:06.416
that's all the videos that exist.

03:06.500 --> 03:08.375
-Huh?
-Yeah.

03:08.875 --> 03:11.041
I think you should reconsider

03:12.583 --> 03:14.583
the medical fees exemption.

03:19.291 --> 03:20.291
I must be going now.

03:21.625 --> 03:22.833
[Shimura] Wait, please.

03:26.916 --> 03:30.166
Will I… see you again?

03:35.333 --> 03:36.208
Mm.

03:42.458 --> 03:43.708
[door opens]

04:01.416 --> 04:03.625
[tender music playing]

04:05.208 --> 04:06.458
Sayonara.

04:10.208 --> 04:12.125
-Are you okay, Mom?
-Mm-hmm.

04:20.583 --> 04:21.583
[Shimura] Here we are.

04:22.541 --> 04:23.666
There you go.

04:24.333 --> 04:25.666
[mom] Phew!

04:26.333 --> 04:27.916
-[Shimura] Okay.
-Thank you.

04:29.166 --> 04:30.083
[nurse] Miss Asamiya.

04:30.166 --> 04:31.833
Oh. Hello there.

04:31.916 --> 04:34.333
Are you okay?
Are you looking for the director?

04:34.416 --> 04:35.625
Uh, no.

04:35.708 --> 04:39.583
Uh… do you know who that person is?

04:40.208 --> 04:42.291
[nurse] Oh, that's Mrs. Shimura.

04:43.291 --> 04:45.625
-He is such a good son.
-At least two miles!

04:45.708 --> 04:47.833
[nurse] His mother is
in and out of hospital,

04:47.916 --> 04:50.375
and he always takes
good care of her like that.

04:50.916 --> 04:52.375
I'm Kaho Asamiya.

04:52.458 --> 04:54.000
Nice to be working here!

04:54.083 --> 04:56.416
If you have any questions,
just ask any of us.

04:57.166 --> 04:58.916
[timer beeping]

04:59.000 --> 05:00.125
Agh! Hot!

05:12.083 --> 05:13.916
There it is! I found it!

05:16.166 --> 05:17.541
Thank you!

05:22.416 --> 05:23.833
No way.

05:27.166 --> 05:28.750
Asamiya!

05:40.958 --> 05:42.166
I'm home.

05:44.333 --> 05:45.541
Where were you?

05:46.916 --> 05:48.250
Nowhere special.

05:48.750 --> 05:50.833
You went to see that guy, Kuwata.

05:53.666 --> 05:54.791
I'm sorry.

05:56.333 --> 05:57.833
I was worried about you.

05:58.333 --> 05:59.583
I went into your room.

05:59.666 --> 06:00.958
[gasps]

06:01.041 --> 06:02.125
Keep out of my business.

06:02.208 --> 06:04.291
What kind of parent
would I be if I didn't?

06:04.375 --> 06:06.416
When I can see that you're in pain.

06:06.958 --> 06:09.083
This is our issue, nothing to do with you.

06:09.166 --> 06:11.333
-You shouldn't interfere.
-No.

06:11.416 --> 06:12.958
I'm responsible too.

06:14.625 --> 06:16.416
I'm saying I'll help you.

06:40.583 --> 06:43.041
I just wanted to say goodbye.

06:43.125 --> 06:45.125
[poignant music playing]

06:53.333 --> 06:54.458
[inaudible]

06:58.625 --> 07:00.666
-[poignant music continues]
-[door opens]

07:02.750 --> 07:03.708
[door closes]

07:03.791 --> 07:06.666
BE STRONGER!
@VIRAL_HIT

07:08.625 --> 07:11.333
You won't get
any more videos from TOU-KEI.

07:18.791 --> 07:20.208
MMA MATCH

07:22.583 --> 07:25.666
-[clicks]
-[crowd clamoring on video]

07:37.125 --> 07:39.125
[suspenseful music playing]

07:56.000 --> 07:58.750
[music fades]

08:02.791 --> 08:03.958
[Eiji sighs]

08:04.541 --> 08:07.416
So… have you made up your mind?

08:08.375 --> 08:11.208
Mm. Yes, I have.

08:11.833 --> 08:14.166
-I see.
-I'm going to the police.

08:15.416 --> 08:17.291
Rumi…

08:20.333 --> 08:22.291
Oh my God.

08:22.791 --> 08:24.208
Tell me you're kidding me.

08:24.291 --> 08:26.291
Or I'll talk to Mr. Kuwata himself.

08:26.375 --> 08:28.666
[laughing]

08:31.500 --> 08:35.166
Oh, yeah? You think
Mr. Kuwata doesn't know?

08:40.166 --> 08:42.791
He's the one who's giving the orders.

08:45.541 --> 08:47.875
He likes to take advantage…

08:47.958 --> 08:53.083
[laughs] …of weak…
and stupid people like you.

08:53.750 --> 08:54.583
Hmm?

08:54.666 --> 08:55.916
Well, then,

08:56.833 --> 08:58.875
what if I go to the police?

08:58.958 --> 08:59.958
[sighs]

09:00.458 --> 09:03.208
You know what'll happen
if you make an enemy out of him.

09:03.708 --> 09:04.791
What?

09:07.041 --> 09:08.541
He'll make you disappear.

09:08.625 --> 09:10.083
[Reo] If he is…

09:12.458 --> 09:14.083
you'd better protect him.

09:15.000 --> 09:16.458
He'll do what?

09:17.125 --> 09:18.750
No, I just can't believe that.

09:19.958 --> 09:21.333
[exhales]

09:21.416 --> 09:23.416
[ominous music playing]

09:24.666 --> 09:25.791
Then…

09:28.083 --> 09:30.291
why don't you see for yourself?

09:30.375 --> 09:31.250
Huh?

09:33.000 --> 09:36.458
There was someone else
who tried to do the same thing as you.

09:39.125 --> 09:40.625
-[groans]
-[laughing]

09:43.833 --> 09:46.458
[grunting]

09:48.208 --> 09:50.333
Are you still alive? [laughs]

09:51.375 --> 09:54.583
[grunting].

10:04.000 --> 10:05.208
No, I'm against it.

10:05.291 --> 10:06.791
You should pull out.

10:08.833 --> 10:12.208
The only reason you've won so far
is because the fight's had no rules.

10:12.833 --> 10:16.166
Facing off with a trained fighter
in a ring is a different story.

10:16.250 --> 10:20.125
Yeah, but I really need this money.

10:21.250 --> 10:24.125
How many people do you think
will donate to you guys now?

10:25.791 --> 10:27.875
Also, man, stop making her suffer.

10:27.958 --> 10:30.416
-Huh?
-Asamiya.

10:30.958 --> 10:33.416
She doesn't want to have to keep
seeing you get hurt like this.

10:35.958 --> 10:37.958
I'm afraid I can't help you with this one.

10:47.000 --> 10:49.500
What am I supposed to do?

10:50.125 --> 10:52.500
If there's no more videos…

10:53.791 --> 10:55.208
[man] Hey, boy.

10:58.166 --> 10:59.833
Do you wanna see TOU-KEI?

10:59.916 --> 11:00.791
Huh?

11:01.291 --> 11:05.833
[mimicking TOU-KEI] Hey my friends!
It's TOU-KEI here!

11:05.916 --> 11:07.916
[quirky electronic music playing]

11:09.208 --> 11:10.333
Huh? What?

11:10.416 --> 11:12.041
[phone ringing]

11:15.833 --> 11:17.166
Aki?

11:17.250 --> 11:21.166
[Aki] Come to my place right now
and bring Logan, who's there with you.

11:23.125 --> 11:25.083
[SHIMERUA] What the hell is going on?

11:26.333 --> 11:28.458
Logan is an old friend of mine.

11:28.541 --> 11:30.625
He's been watching Viral Hit.

11:31.125 --> 11:31.958
Okay, wait.

11:32.041 --> 11:34.625
-TOU-KEI, you've known about him too.
-It's no big deal.

11:35.416 --> 11:36.750
I'm interested.

11:37.250 --> 11:39.458
How did you get access to the vids?

11:40.458 --> 11:41.291
Oh.

11:43.666 --> 11:46.625
The person who found this sent them to me.

11:47.250 --> 11:48.791
This is mine.

11:48.875 --> 11:50.125
You piss me off.

11:50.208 --> 11:51.750
You gloomy-ass bitch.

11:53.625 --> 11:55.708
You've had this the entire time?

11:55.791 --> 11:57.333
So, then,

11:58.250 --> 12:00.166
Mr. Logan, you're TOU-KEI, aren't you?

12:00.250 --> 12:01.541
[chuckles] No.

12:01.625 --> 12:02.458
Huh?

12:03.375 --> 12:05.750
Then… who is TOU-KEI?

12:06.250 --> 12:07.083
[man] It's me.

12:10.166 --> 12:12.583
[tense music playing]

12:12.666 --> 12:14.000
You're kidding!

12:14.875 --> 12:16.458
Good to see you again, Master.

12:17.083 --> 12:18.000
Master?

12:18.083 --> 12:21.750
Please don't call me that.
I don't deserve that title.

12:21.833 --> 12:25.625
My father was a UFC fighter
in the American Association.

12:26.708 --> 12:32.000
After I retired, I became Logan's coach.
And then he got injured during practice.

12:32.083 --> 12:34.166
He felt it was his fault.

12:34.250 --> 12:37.208
So, he left the fighting world
and we moved back here.

12:37.291 --> 12:39.750
But your body, it's, uh…

12:39.833 --> 12:42.875
[grunts] It's shrunk a bit now, right?

12:42.958 --> 12:44.000
Yoga will do that.

12:44.083 --> 12:45.125
Yoga?

12:45.208 --> 12:47.666
The secret
to Rickson and Gracie's strength,

12:47.750 --> 12:49.583
I'll tell you now, it's yoga.

12:49.666 --> 12:50.625
You should try it.

12:51.708 --> 12:53.875
[laughs] Ah, I'll pass. Thank you.

12:53.958 --> 12:58.000
Those videos…
they were made for Aki here.

12:58.916 --> 13:00.541
Made for Aki?

13:00.625 --> 13:01.750
Mm.

13:02.250 --> 13:05.791
You see Aki had
a difficult time adjusting to life abroad.

13:06.291 --> 13:10.291
-[chirping]
-And her only friend… was a pet chicken.

13:11.750 --> 13:13.375
[young Aki crying]

13:13.458 --> 13:16.833
[Aki's dad] But, that chicken… he died.

13:16.916 --> 13:18.916
[tender music playing]2

13:48.500 --> 13:50.750
BE STRONGER!

13:52.541 --> 13:55.791
Hello, guys! My name is TOU-KEI.

13:56.500 --> 13:59.708
Why don't you come
and get stronger with me?

13:59.791 --> 14:04.166
At first, I made them to cheer Aki up,
but then I guess I started to get into it.

14:04.250 --> 14:06.500
I was glad. It was good.

14:06.583 --> 14:07.541
Huh?

14:09.333 --> 14:11.291
I heard everything from Aki.

14:11.375 --> 14:14.416
I swore to never get involved
in martial arts again.

14:14.500 --> 14:15.833
But Aki chose you, son.

14:15.916 --> 14:18.041
Now I need to see
if you're worthy of my daughter--

14:18.125 --> 14:20.250
-No, I think there's--
-There's not a lot of time.

14:20.333 --> 14:21.583
We start right away.

14:22.583 --> 14:24.125
-Let's get to it.
-Yeah.

14:25.625 --> 14:27.833
[dramatic brass music playing]

14:34.666 --> 14:36.250
-Keep up!
-Yes, Sir.

14:38.500 --> 14:40.166
-One, two! Come on!
-[Shimura grunts]

14:40.250 --> 14:41.750
-One, two!
-[Shimura grunting]

14:41.833 --> 14:43.041
-One, two! Ha!
-[Shimura] Ha!

14:43.125 --> 14:44.291
[Aki's dad] One, two, hook.

14:45.791 --> 14:48.208
-Come on, come on!
-[Shimura] Ready now. Jab! Jab!

14:49.250 --> 14:51.666
-[Shimura grunting]
-Come on! Raise your elbow!

14:51.750 --> 14:52.833
[groaning]

14:52.916 --> 14:55.375
[Aki's dad] Come on, higher. Higher, yeah.

14:55.458 --> 14:56.625
-[Shimura grunting]
-More!

14:56.708 --> 14:59.375
Plant your feet, raise it. Plant! Raise!

15:02.208 --> 15:03.458
Breath, breath, breath.

15:04.250 --> 15:07.083
Breathe down into your belly now.
That's it. That's it.

15:07.166 --> 15:10.250
-Good, good.  Now, higher!
-[Shimura grunting]

15:12.458 --> 15:14.291
-And, roll!
-[Shimura grunting]

15:17.375 --> 15:22.375
[choir vocalizing triumphantly]

15:28.291 --> 15:33.500
HIS FAMILY IS DIRT POOR LOL

15:34.791 --> 15:36.708
VIRAL HIT
ONSLAUGHT OF DEATH THREATS!!!

15:39.500 --> 15:41.458
[straining]

15:43.833 --> 15:44.666
[huffing]

15:49.625 --> 15:50.875
[grunting]

15:54.666 --> 15:57.416
-[Shimura grunting]
-[Aki's dad] Give me more!

15:57.500 --> 16:00.708
[coughing]

16:00.791 --> 16:02.000
[yells] Ah!

16:02.500 --> 16:03.375
[grunts]

16:03.458 --> 16:06.000
Yes! Very good! Come on, go again!

16:06.083 --> 16:07.500
[straining]

16:08.916 --> 16:11.416
[coughing]

16:11.500 --> 16:16.291
[choir vocalizing triumphantly]

16:33.750 --> 16:35.333
[Aki] You're ready!

16:36.625 --> 16:39.791
[panting]

16:41.000 --> 16:43.250
Ah! Ah!

16:44.333 --> 16:46.583
You've done well to hold out this long.

16:48.250 --> 16:51.541
Tomorrow will be the last day of training.

16:52.208 --> 16:53.291
Can I…

16:54.208 --> 16:55.500
Can I win with this?

16:56.791 --> 16:58.166
Uh…

16:59.333 --> 17:00.916
I'm sorry, but no.

17:02.166 --> 17:04.083
You won't be able to win the game.

17:05.208 --> 17:06.208
Huh?

17:08.333 --> 17:10.333
[silent]

17:20.875 --> 17:22.291
USING A CAMERA IS TIRING

17:22.375 --> 17:23.875
YOU'RE MAKING A LADY WORK

17:29.125 --> 17:30.291
READ

17:30.375 --> 17:32.666
[gentle music playing]

17:34.458 --> 17:36.500
[Aki] Hey, what are you doing?

17:38.875 --> 17:41.458
You're the one who started Viral Hit.

17:41.958 --> 17:43.750
What are we going to do without you?

17:45.583 --> 17:47.708
Shimura is worried about you too.

17:51.333 --> 17:52.208
Sheesh!

17:52.791 --> 17:54.666
You're making a girl work hard here.

17:56.500 --> 17:58.166
AKI YASHIO

17:59.083 --> 18:00.833
[phone ringing]

18:07.625 --> 18:10.083
[outgoing call ringing]

18:16.458 --> 18:17.458
[ends call]

18:21.125 --> 18:22.583
There you are!

18:26.208 --> 18:29.833
So things have gotten wild, you know.

18:30.916 --> 18:35.458
The Viral Hit you created
has truly gone viral.

18:40.958 --> 18:42.041
[voice breaking] Aki…

18:44.500 --> 18:45.750
I'm sorry.

18:46.666 --> 18:47.541
I…

18:47.625 --> 18:49.750
[Aki] I preferred…

18:51.750 --> 18:54.791
Viral Hit with you a part of it.

19:01.083 --> 19:04.458
You are a… great producer, you know?

19:06.666 --> 19:08.750
We need you on the team.

19:13.041 --> 19:14.375
Come back to us.

19:16.166 --> 19:17.541
We'll be waiting for you.

19:30.708 --> 19:32.875
[poignant music playing]

19:35.208 --> 19:38.916
VIRAL HIT BELONGS TO THE THREE OF US

19:47.000 --> 19:49.000
[crying]

19:51.333 --> 19:52.208
[sniffles]

19:56.875 --> 19:57.708
[sniffles]

20:10.000 --> 20:12.000
[music fades]

20:15.875 --> 20:17.625
[Shimura's mom] Tomorrow is the big day.

20:17.708 --> 20:18.708
Mm.

20:19.375 --> 20:20.958
-This is…
-Oh.

20:21.958 --> 20:24.416
Feels like
it's already getting a bit warm.

20:26.208 --> 20:27.833
Maybe I can use it next year.

20:28.750 --> 20:31.750
Mm. Okay, I'll wear it. Thanks.

20:37.125 --> 20:38.166
I'm sorry.

20:40.250 --> 20:43.000
I'm afraid this is all I can do for you.

20:45.041 --> 20:47.041
Where's this coming from?

20:48.083 --> 20:50.708
I wish I could find the ones
who are bad-mouthing you

20:50.791 --> 20:53.333
and give them a piece of my mind.

20:55.583 --> 20:58.291
To tell them that you're
a really kindhearted kid.

21:01.250 --> 21:02.625
You don't need to.

21:04.541 --> 21:07.500
If only I wasn't stuck in here like this.

21:09.500 --> 21:11.333
I wish that you could do

21:11.833 --> 21:13.791
the things you really want to.

21:21.458 --> 21:23.333
You know, at first…

21:27.458 --> 21:29.375
I was doing it for you.

21:29.833 --> 21:32.458
-And then I think it changed.
-[gentle music playing]

21:32.541 --> 21:33.666
And now…

21:35.416 --> 21:37.333
there's more to it, really, you know.

21:39.708 --> 21:42.375
It made me realize
there's things I can do.

21:43.375 --> 21:46.208
Even though I thought
I couldn't do anything.

21:47.666 --> 21:50.291
I feel like I'm alive right now.

21:52.041 --> 21:53.333
I've never…

21:55.750 --> 21:58.500
felt anything like this before.

22:01.375 --> 22:02.666
And also,

22:04.333 --> 22:06.708
I've made friends and it's great.

22:08.416 --> 22:10.625
To tell you the absolute truth,

22:11.125 --> 22:13.250
they're really quite annoying

22:13.958 --> 22:15.458
and irritating.

22:16.875 --> 22:18.041
You know?

22:22.541 --> 22:23.416
And…

22:24.458 --> 22:26.958
I'm having the time of my life.

22:29.125 --> 22:31.083
You said to me…

22:31.833 --> 22:35.041
that you're only young once.

22:38.083 --> 22:41.083
Viral Hit. This is my youth.

22:44.041 --> 22:48.291
I'll try my very best…
in this final match.

22:49.958 --> 22:51.041
So…

23:00.125 --> 23:01.208
So…

23:04.708 --> 23:06.833
Don't you give up either.

23:10.083 --> 23:13.208
I think you worry too much about me,
you know. [crying]

23:15.208 --> 23:17.416
I'm not gonna die so easily.

23:19.916 --> 23:20.750
[sniffles]

23:20.833 --> 23:24.458
You should really be
worrying about yourself.

23:29.333 --> 23:31.541
I don't want to see you get hit.

23:33.041 --> 23:35.500
Or see you hitting anybody else.

23:45.458 --> 23:48.125
Don't you dare
even think about dying before me.

23:51.875 --> 23:52.833
[sniffling]

24:15.125 --> 24:17.125
[music fades]

24:22.791 --> 24:23.625
DOXXED

24:23.708 --> 24:26.541
HOT GIRLFRIEND'S DAD
RUNS URABE GENERAL HOSPITAL

24:30.541 --> 24:31.958
[boy 1] Oh, wow.

24:32.041 --> 24:35.250
-Isn't that… What?
-[boy 2] Wait, wait, wait.

24:35.333 --> 24:37.625
-[girl 1] Huh? Wow.
-[boy 1] Is that Viral Hit's girlfriend?

24:37.708 --> 24:39.958
-[boy 2] The one that stages their shows?
-[boy 1] Yeah!

24:40.041 --> 24:42.625
[boy 2] Huh? She looks
nothing like the photos.

24:42.708 --> 24:45.708
-[girl 2] Hey, that girl.
-[girl 3] It's definitely her, right?

24:45.791 --> 24:46.875
[girl 3] It totally is.

24:46.958 --> 24:47.916
HER NAME IS KAHO ASAMIYA

24:48.375 --> 24:50.083
SHE'S A SENSELESS SPOILED BRAT

24:50.166 --> 24:51.583
SHE DESERVED THE ASSAULT

24:51.666 --> 24:53.666
[tense music playing]

24:57.208 --> 24:58.250
[gasps]

24:58.916 --> 25:00.916
[tense music continues]

25:02.833 --> 25:05.583
[Kuwata] These childish games
won't work forever.

25:05.666 --> 25:08.208
[Toru] This must be his doing.
Kuwata must be pulling the strings.

25:08.291 --> 25:10.750
[Aki] He saw Kuwata at the scene
where his friend died.

25:10.833 --> 25:13.291
[Ogi] How many people
do you think will donate to you guys now?

25:13.375 --> 25:15.125
[Kaho] I think you should reconsider.

25:15.208 --> 25:17.500
[Shimura's mom] I don't want to see
you get hit.

25:18.625 --> 25:21.166
Or see you hitting anybody else.

25:21.250 --> 25:24.208
Don't you dare
even think about dying before me.

25:41.333 --> 25:43.958
[music fades]

25:44.041 --> 25:46.458
[birds twittering]

25:53.583 --> 25:55.208
Okay, here we go.

25:57.708 --> 25:59.875
[zipping]

26:23.166 --> 26:25.166
[inaudible]

26:27.166 --> 26:29.166
[eerie music playing]

26:35.958 --> 26:37.041
[Kota gasps]

26:38.250 --> 26:40.250
[no audible dialogue]

26:42.541 --> 26:43.916
[footsteps depart]

26:44.000 --> 26:45.083
[door opens]

26:46.125 --> 26:47.208
[door closes]

27:06.500 --> 27:08.500
[spectators clamoring]

27:14.416 --> 27:16.416
GIRLFRIEND HOPED TO
GET INTO MED SCHOOL!

27:16.500 --> 27:17.750
[Shimura] Aki, tell me honestly.

27:17.833 --> 27:18.666
NOT FIT TO BE A DOC

27:19.166 --> 27:21.625
Do you think
what I've been doing is wrong?

27:22.708 --> 27:24.083
What are you saying?

27:25.791 --> 27:27.250
It's just that

27:28.000 --> 27:30.750
friends who are
important to me have got hurt.

27:32.250 --> 27:35.083
And I never set out to hurt anyone at all.

27:37.458 --> 27:39.458
[gentle music playing]

27:43.083 --> 27:44.541
There's also

27:45.458 --> 27:47.708
other people who you have saved.

27:52.083 --> 27:53.791
And I think

27:54.291 --> 27:56.041
that I'm one of them.

27:59.541 --> 28:00.791
Without you…

28:03.291 --> 28:05.416
I would still be all alone.

28:12.625 --> 28:13.625
Shimura.

28:16.666 --> 28:18.125
To me, you're my

28:19.833 --> 28:21.500
one and only hero. [chuckles]

28:26.791 --> 28:27.833
That's nice.

28:29.166 --> 28:30.416
[knocking]

28:32.625 --> 28:34.541
-It's time.
-Okay.

28:40.416 --> 28:42.083
Remember what I said.

28:42.583 --> 28:44.583
Shimura, you're not alone.

28:44.666 --> 28:47.833
TOU-KEI

28:56.708 --> 28:58.250
All right, let's go.

28:58.750 --> 29:01.625
Let's show them all what Viral Hit can do.

29:01.708 --> 29:03.500
You can count on it.

29:04.125 --> 29:05.750
I'll hit him real hard.

29:05.833 --> 29:08.375
Oh, yeah. You send him flying!

29:08.458 --> 29:10.458
[dramatic rock music playing]

29:12.958 --> 29:19.791
BAD FELLOWS

29:21.708 --> 29:27.083
[announcer] Thank you for waiting.
We will now commence with the main event.

29:27.166 --> 29:29.208
[crowd cheering]

29:29.291 --> 29:33.333
In the blue corner,
a local high school student

29:33.416 --> 29:37.625
whose live stream fights
have taken the world by storm.

29:38.125 --> 29:39.916
From Viral Hit…

29:40.791 --> 29:44.708
Kota Shimura!

29:44.791 --> 29:47.500
[crowd clamoring, jeering]

29:56.333 --> 29:58.541
[jeering continues]

29:58.625 --> 30:00.916
[crowd booing]

30:18.125 --> 30:19.666
[Ogi] This is totally an away game.

30:23.000 --> 30:24.500
[Aki's dad] All right.

30:25.166 --> 30:26.583
Do your best.

30:26.666 --> 30:28.666
[dramatic rock music continues]

30:34.583 --> 30:37.750
KUWATA 172,300 YEN VS SHIMURA 300 YEN

30:40.583 --> 30:43.208
[announcer] Next, in the red corner,

30:44.291 --> 30:46.958
BAD FELLOWS creator and owner…

30:47.041 --> 30:48.375
[crowd clamoring]

30:48.458 --> 30:52.166
…and a revolutionary
in the world of martial arts,

30:52.250 --> 30:55.125
Yugo Kuwata!

30:55.750 --> 30:58.166
-[man 1] Go Kuwata!
-[man 2] You're the best, Kuwata!

30:58.250 --> 31:01.625
-[crowd cheering, whooping]
-[hip-hop music playing]

31:03.666 --> 31:06.291
[man 3] Kuwata! Kuwata!

31:10.291 --> 31:12.125
[man 4] Let's go, Kuwata!

31:12.208 --> 31:14.583
[girls screaming]

31:14.666 --> 31:16.250
Yeah, Kuwata.

31:38.333 --> 31:39.416
[referee] Center!

31:44.166 --> 31:46.291
Three rounds. No headbutting.

31:46.375 --> 31:49.000
Hitting the back of the head,
spine strikes, groin strikes,

31:49.083 --> 31:50.708
biting, or eye-gouging.

31:51.291 --> 31:52.291
Touch gloves.

31:55.500 --> 31:58.666
What do you say?
Gonna make a lot of money today?

32:01.041 --> 32:02.500
I'm sure they're all dying to see it.

32:02.583 --> 32:03.458
KUWATA VS SHIMURA

32:04.208 --> 32:08.000
They want to see you, the villain,
get beaten and humiliated.

32:09.125 --> 32:11.750
You're the one who's gonna get beaten.

32:13.166 --> 32:15.791
Okay. Back to your corners.

32:18.208 --> 32:20.458
[crowd roaring on live stream]

32:24.041 --> 32:25.833
[announcer] Round one!

32:25.916 --> 32:27.125
-Fight.
-[dings]

32:28.750 --> 32:30.500
[crowd roaring]

32:33.916 --> 32:35.458
[man 5] Go, Kuwata.

32:37.541 --> 32:38.416
[Shimura grunts]

32:44.125 --> 32:46.250
[crowd cheering, whooping]

32:48.791 --> 32:50.375
[both grunting]

32:51.833 --> 32:54.958
What's the matter, huh?
You haven't landed a single punch.

32:59.375 --> 33:01.500
[both grunting]

33:04.416 --> 33:06.125
[man 6] Beat him down, Kuwata!

33:06.208 --> 33:08.250
[crowd clamoring]

33:08.333 --> 33:11.375
You won't make any money
if the game ends in the first round.

33:12.708 --> 33:14.125
Yeah, you better get up.

33:18.916 --> 33:19.875
SHIMURA 300YEN

33:19.958 --> 33:21.458
[Aki] It's not good.

33:29.750 --> 33:30.916
START LIVE STREAM

33:31.000 --> 33:31.875
[beeps]

33:37.750 --> 33:39.208
Hello everyone.

33:39.291 --> 33:40.750
IS IT REALLY HER?
HE'S FIGHTING NOW!

33:40.833 --> 33:44.833
I'm the one causing
the stir on social media.

33:47.416 --> 33:49.333
I'm Viral Hit's girlfriend.

33:49.416 --> 33:52.416
VIRAL HIT'S GIRLFRIEND IS LIVE!

33:52.500 --> 33:55.000
[crowd clamoring on live stream]

33:55.083 --> 33:56.541
I've now seen…

33:58.541 --> 34:02.791
many comments bashing Shimura,
saying he's making money out of violence.

34:03.916 --> 34:04.916
It's true.

34:06.208 --> 34:09.000
We shouldn't ever justify
acts of violence.

34:10.250 --> 34:11.083
But…

34:13.166 --> 34:15.500
I'm partially the one you should accuse…

34:17.208 --> 34:18.916
of turning him to violence.

34:19.000 --> 34:21.000
[poignant music playing]

34:22.000 --> 34:23.416
I have lived

34:24.250 --> 34:25.958
my life in shackles

34:26.541 --> 34:29.250
doing whatever my parents instructed.

34:29.791 --> 34:32.166
At some point,
I had stopped fighting back.

34:32.250 --> 34:35.208
I thought it was somewhat easier this way.

34:37.291 --> 34:39.625
To stay weak rather than resist.

34:42.000 --> 34:44.416
Facing reality and fighting back

34:45.041 --> 34:46.791
takes a lot of courage.

34:47.708 --> 34:49.791
It's not easy to accomplish.

34:51.291 --> 34:53.125
I started to see

34:53.625 --> 34:55.250
myself in Shimura's image.

34:56.458 --> 34:58.375
When Shimura fought,

34:59.333 --> 35:02.000
I felt like I'd also become stronger.

35:04.000 --> 35:05.375
Surely…

35:05.458 --> 35:06.458
HE GAVE ME COURAGE

35:06.541 --> 35:07.541
TRUE

35:07.625 --> 35:09.833
…I wasn't the only one.

35:09.916 --> 35:11.083
I'M TEARING UP

35:11.166 --> 35:12.750
MY HEART IS POUNDING

35:12.833 --> 35:14.750
Shimura is strong.

35:17.958 --> 35:19.875
He made a choice to protect another.

35:21.958 --> 35:24.500
The only way he could change his reality,

35:26.916 --> 35:29.625
was by raising both his fists high.

35:36.166 --> 35:39.125
If you're going to criticize Shimura
for these acts…

35:39.250 --> 35:40.333
I MISUNDERSTOOD HIM

35:40.416 --> 35:44.875
…then what about the justice
you demand hiding behind screens.

35:45.541 --> 35:47.916
You make accusations
and you gang up on him

35:48.000 --> 35:49.500
when you think it's okay.

35:50.583 --> 35:52.083
I think your justice…

35:54.166 --> 35:56.291
is the worst type of violence.

36:00.625 --> 36:03.041
I won't run or hide anymore.

36:04.750 --> 36:05.875
That's why

36:07.291 --> 36:09.833
I chose to talk to you all here like this.

36:11.750 --> 36:14.375
To fight against invisible violence.

36:22.208 --> 36:24.250
[crowd cheering]

36:24.791 --> 36:26.000
[both grunting]

36:26.083 --> 36:27.416
[punch echoes]

36:31.458 --> 36:32.708
[crowd cheering]

36:32.791 --> 36:33.625
[dings]

36:34.750 --> 36:35.875
[Shimura exhales]

36:39.208 --> 36:40.541
[groaning]

36:44.791 --> 36:46.375
[crowd clamoring]

36:48.666 --> 36:49.541
Thanks.

36:53.500 --> 36:55.166
Shimura. Look at this.

36:56.916 --> 36:58.875
Donations are starting to pour in.

36:58.958 --> 36:59.833
What?

37:00.791 --> 37:02.000
It's Asamiya! What's she doing?

37:02.083 --> 37:03.333
YOUR GIRLFRIEND'S STORY MOVED ME

37:03.416 --> 37:04.541
[Toru] Let me go!

37:04.625 --> 37:05.750
Let go of me!

37:05.833 --> 37:07.500
Hey! Take your hands off!

37:07.583 --> 37:09.875
-Kaneko!
-Hey, Shimura!

37:13.250 --> 37:15.333
-Sorry, I'm late.
-What happened to your face?

37:16.500 --> 37:19.791
Some punks hassled me on the way.
Don't worry about it.

37:20.291 --> 37:23.250
How's it going?
My counterpunch did the trick, didn't it?

37:23.333 --> 37:25.291
YOUR GIRLFRIEND IS ROOTING FOR YOU

37:26.166 --> 37:27.333
[gasps]

37:30.750 --> 37:33.791
Hey, Viral Hit's girlfriend,
I need a favor.

37:33.875 --> 37:35.166
Was this your doing?

37:35.250 --> 37:39.375
I guess so. And there's…
more than one punch to come.

37:40.958 --> 37:42.583
Right now, she's causing a stir.

37:44.375 --> 37:46.541
KOTA SHIMURA 145,900 YEN

37:46.625 --> 37:47.500
[sighs]

37:47.583 --> 37:49.458
[clears throat] Asshole!

37:53.000 --> 37:53.875
Rumi.

37:54.583 --> 37:55.958
What the hell are you doing here?

37:56.041 --> 37:58.208
I thought that I should come
and let you know.

37:58.291 --> 38:01.416
[Eiji] You know what'll happen
if you make an enemy of him.

38:01.500 --> 38:02.500
[Rumi] What?

38:02.583 --> 38:04.208
[Eiji] He'll make you disappear.

38:04.291 --> 38:07.791
[Rumi] I heard he's killed
a person before.

38:07.875 --> 38:09.166
What the hell have you done?

38:09.833 --> 38:11.125
[Rumi] Is it true?

38:12.250 --> 38:15.250
He and a group of men,
they beat a boy to death.

38:15.333 --> 38:16.458
[huffs]

38:16.541 --> 38:18.666
It wasn't a group of men.

38:19.250 --> 38:20.583
It was Kuwata.

38:21.083 --> 38:24.541
-Kuwata killed him alone.
-[gasps] Wow!

38:24.625 --> 38:27.000
I just posted it.
It's already got 10,000 likes.

38:27.083 --> 38:29.833
-Bitch. You understand what you've done?
-[Rumi] Hey.

38:30.708 --> 38:32.875
Maybe you're gonna be the one

38:33.750 --> 38:35.250
that'll disappear.

38:37.958 --> 38:38.958
[gasps]

38:39.958 --> 38:41.958
[spluttering]

38:42.458 --> 38:43.916
[crying]

38:47.041 --> 38:49.291
It's Viral Hit's time now.

38:50.750 --> 38:52.000
[women scream]

38:53.250 --> 38:54.083
[gasps]

38:56.166 --> 38:57.333
Good work.

38:58.291 --> 39:00.208
-[crowd clamoring]
-[Toru] Shimura.

39:00.291 --> 39:02.125
There's nothing to worry about now.

39:02.208 --> 39:03.541
[tense music playing]

39:03.625 --> 39:05.125
You're not the only one.

39:05.208 --> 39:07.041
You're not alone there in the ring.

39:08.458 --> 39:09.375
We're all here

39:09.958 --> 39:11.625
fighting alongside you.

39:13.083 --> 39:14.250
Go knock him out!

39:15.333 --> 39:18.041
All right.
We'll use our trick in this round.

39:26.625 --> 39:28.750
Seconds out, please. Seconds out.

39:30.416 --> 39:32.291
Round two!

39:32.375 --> 39:34.291
-[dings]
-Fight! Go Shimura!

39:38.333 --> 39:39.250
Yeah!

39:41.416 --> 39:43.458
[Aki] The donations are skyrocketing!

39:43.541 --> 39:45.125
How did you make this happen?

39:46.000 --> 39:49.791
I told you. I'm a great producer, you see?

39:49.875 --> 39:52.291
[all chattering]

39:53.916 --> 39:54.791
Yeah!

39:54.875 --> 39:57.000
[both grunting]

40:00.333 --> 40:01.333
[grunts]

40:05.041 --> 40:05.916
What's wrong?

40:06.000 --> 40:08.583
Huh? What was it you did? What?

40:08.666 --> 40:10.291
-Vegetable oil.
-[Toru] What?

40:10.375 --> 40:12.083
What a dirty trick.

40:12.708 --> 40:15.375
It's a fight. Isn't it?

40:16.833 --> 40:17.958
[grunts]

40:18.041 --> 40:19.416
I need your strength.

40:19.500 --> 40:21.125
[tense music continues]

40:21.208 --> 40:25.875
Oh, and… please, everyone support Shimura.

40:25.958 --> 40:27.833
-What are you doing?!
-[crying]

40:27.916 --> 40:29.333
-Give it to me!
-No, stop it!

40:29.416 --> 40:30.750
Give… give it!

40:31.333 --> 40:34.083
How much more will you humiliate me
before you're satisfied?

40:34.166 --> 40:35.291
Leave me alone!

40:36.083 --> 40:39.666
Do you… even understand what you're doing?

40:41.166 --> 40:43.166
Now, this is why you're such a failure!

40:43.250 --> 40:44.666
I've had enough!

40:45.458 --> 40:46.750
[music fades]

40:46.833 --> 40:49.416
[Shimura roaring]

40:52.416 --> 40:54.208
-[tense music resumes]
-[crowd roaring]

40:56.625 --> 40:59.375
[Shimura] Fighting mindset,
rule number one.

40:59.458 --> 41:01.250
Don't lost your cool. 

41:02.666 --> 41:05.125
You little asshole.

41:05.208 --> 41:07.625
[approaching motorcycle revving]

41:10.875 --> 41:12.750
-Get on.
-Tatsuya.

41:12.833 --> 41:15.208
[fighters grunting]

41:18.166 --> 41:20.875
[Toru] Run. Run!  Come on! Get up!

41:20.958 --> 41:22.708
[Aki] Shimura, go!

41:22.791 --> 41:25.083
[suspenseful music playing]

41:27.000 --> 41:29.041
[fighters continue grunting]

41:29.125 --> 41:31.708
This is bad.
That one punch, it made him angry.

41:35.250 --> 41:36.375
Guard. Guard!

41:40.541 --> 41:41.958
[crying]

41:50.750 --> 41:53.291
[crowd clamoring, booing]

41:53.375 --> 41:55.291
[shakily] Shimura! Shimura!

41:55.375 --> 41:57.375
[referee] And down! Back to your corner!

41:57.458 --> 42:00.125
-How much have we made so far?
-Only about two million.

42:00.208 --> 42:01.750
-[crowd] Three! Four!
-Shimura! Get up!

42:01.833 --> 42:03.250
-You can't be done!
-[crowd] Five!

42:03.333 --> 42:08.291
-[Toru] Get up, Shimura!
-[crowd] Six! Seven! Eight! Nine!

42:08.375 --> 42:10.916
You okay? You're good? All right!

42:11.541 --> 42:12.750
-[dings]
-[referee] Stop!

42:12.833 --> 42:16.708
[crowd clamoring, booing]

42:20.500 --> 42:21.500
Come here.

42:25.416 --> 42:26.708
Saved by the bell.

42:30.833 --> 42:32.291
[gasping] What did we make?

42:32.375 --> 42:33.791
Only around two million.

42:34.666 --> 42:36.916
I see. That's not enough.

42:37.416 --> 42:40.333
Shimura, this next round is the last.

42:40.416 --> 42:41.416
Hang on till the end.

42:42.000 --> 42:43.166
I know, I know.

42:43.250 --> 42:45.875
Show them what Viral Hit's made of.
You can do this!

42:46.916 --> 42:50.041
[announcer] Seconds out.
Seconds out, please.

42:50.125 --> 42:51.458
Your mom's watching.

42:54.916 --> 42:55.833
[sniffs]

42:55.916 --> 42:57.041
[exhales]

42:57.125 --> 42:59.083
[suspenseful music playing]

43:04.083 --> 43:06.333
[announcer] Final round!

43:06.416 --> 43:07.416
-Fight!
-[dings]

43:09.125 --> 43:10.541
[fighters grunting]

43:22.125 --> 43:24.583
That's good! Keep going like that!

43:27.083 --> 43:28.333
Go Shimura!

43:30.833 --> 43:31.833
[music stops]

43:32.833 --> 43:35.750
What are you doing?!
Think about your training!

43:35.833 --> 43:37.833
[suspenseful music resumes]

44:04.083 --> 44:05.708
[music intensifies]

44:10.458 --> 44:11.791
[both gasps]

44:14.625 --> 44:16.625
-Yes, Shimura!
-Go, now! Go!

44:16.708 --> 44:17.583
[gasps]

44:18.291 --> 44:21.125
[revving]

44:24.875 --> 44:26.583
-Thank you, Tatsuya.
-Go quickly.

44:26.666 --> 44:27.625
[grunts]

44:38.291 --> 44:40.750
-[cracking]
-[Shimura screams]

44:40.833 --> 44:42.625
[Shimura yelping]

44:50.500 --> 44:52.625
[music fades]

45:14.750 --> 45:16.458
[crowd clamoring]

45:16.541 --> 45:17.375
Shimura!

45:17.458 --> 45:19.583
-Down! Neutral!
-[announcer] Down!

45:20.208 --> 45:22.416
[referee and announcer] One! Two!

45:23.208 --> 45:24.208
This is bad.

45:25.041 --> 45:26.000
[announcer] Three…

45:26.083 --> 45:27.416
Hang in there.

45:27.500 --> 45:29.500
-[muffled] Get up!
-Get up, Shimura!

45:29.583 --> 45:32.666
[echoing] Get up!

45:53.708 --> 45:56.208
[dreamy music playing]

46:11.791 --> 46:14.291
HEY, GET UP

46:14.375 --> 46:16.833
PLEASE GET UP

46:19.833 --> 46:21.791
IT'S NOT THE END YET

46:21.875 --> 46:24.083
I NEED YOU TO GET UP!

46:47.041 --> 46:48.541
YOU GAVE US COURAGE

46:48.625 --> 46:50.708
NOW IT'S OUR TURN TO HELP YOU

46:52.625 --> 46:54.166
WE'LL NEVER ABANDON YOU

46:54.250 --> 46:56.625
WE'RE YOUR FRIENDS TOO

47:01.375 --> 47:03.750
LET US DREAM ONE MORE TIME

47:03.833 --> 47:06.333
[music fades]

47:07.541 --> 47:09.916
[suspenseful music playing]

47:10.000 --> 47:11.833
-[Aki] Shimura! Get up!
-[crowd clamoring]

47:11.916 --> 47:13.916
[Toru] Get up!

47:14.000 --> 47:16.375
-Get up, Shimura! Stand up!
-[Toru] Yes!

47:16.458 --> 47:18.083
[gasping]

47:19.458 --> 47:20.333
Seven!

47:21.416 --> 47:24.666
[all cheering]

47:24.750 --> 47:26.291
-Eight!
-[Shimura gasping]

47:26.375 --> 47:28.125
-[crowd cheering]
-Nine!

47:28.208 --> 47:29.250
[referee] You okay?

47:31.333 --> 47:33.416
[rock music playing]

47:34.125 --> 47:35.333
Shimura!

47:36.416 --> 47:38.958
Donations are pouring in like crazy.

47:39.041 --> 47:42.833
Shimura! Not much longer!
Hang in there till the end!

47:42.916 --> 47:44.083
[referee] Can you do it?

47:45.958 --> 47:46.791
Fight!

47:50.666 --> 47:51.541
[grunting]

47:53.208 --> 47:55.833
-[growls]
-[groaning]

48:02.291 --> 48:03.541
[bell dings]

48:04.375 --> 48:05.541
I'm sorry, but no.

48:07.375 --> 48:09.250
You won't be able to win the game.

48:14.916 --> 48:16.458
But I only mean the game.

48:18.375 --> 48:20.208
So he can still beat Kuwata?

48:20.291 --> 48:21.791
In a fight, yes.

48:21.875 --> 48:24.000
[rock music playing]

48:42.916 --> 48:44.833
[roaring] Ya!

48:46.916 --> 48:49.000
-[dinging]
-[referee] Stop! He's down!

48:51.708 --> 48:57.833
[announcer] Due to Shimura's foul,
the winner of the match is Yugo Kuwata!

48:57.916 --> 49:00.083
[rock music fanfare playing]

49:00.166 --> 49:02.791
[crowd clamoring]

49:08.458 --> 49:09.291
IT'S A MIRACLE

49:11.291 --> 49:12.166
[inaudible]

49:16.333 --> 49:17.875
Well done!

49:18.458 --> 49:21.916
You really are the best streamer ever!

49:24.833 --> 49:27.000
[gasping]

49:27.083 --> 49:29.750
[both squealing]

49:29.833 --> 49:31.500
[music subsides]

49:31.583 --> 49:32.416
You pass.

49:32.500 --> 49:34.583
[poignant music playing]

49:38.416 --> 49:39.416
[crying]

49:40.916 --> 49:43.000
[crying]

49:52.333 --> 49:53.208
How much?

49:54.291 --> 49:55.791
What did we earn?

49:56.375 --> 49:59.041
[Japanese rock music playing]

50:08.208 --> 50:15.208
VIRAL HIT

50:20.416 --> 50:22.333
[Japanese rock music continues]

51:31.833 --> 51:32.833
[music ends]
